    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Well presented 2-Bedroom, 1-Bathroom ground floor apartment in the popular Ashwood development.\r\n\r\nA very well maintained 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartment located in the very popular Ashwood development withing walking distance of  Westport town centre. This turn key property offers comfortable modern living, with parking and enclosed patio area.\r\n\r\nIdeally situated close to Westport town centre, train station, Tesco, schools, bars, restaurants, shop, and all local amenities, this property is perfect for families, first-time buyers, or investors looking for quality home in a prime location.\r\n\r\nThe property accommodation consists of:\r\nEntrance/Kitchen/Dining, Living Room with Balcony/Patio, 2 Double Bedrooms with built in wardrobes, Main Bathroom and Hot press.\r\n\r\nAshwood is a beautifully developed offering over three acres of woodland, riverside walking paths and lots of green areas.  \r\n\r\nViewing strictly by appointment only."
      },
